{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>陳庭欣於11月23日出席《歡樂滿東華2026》記者會時，親自為暗撻燈飾店老闆Gary長達半年的傳聞解畫。面對被 …</p><p></p>\n<p>陳庭欣於11月23日出席《歡樂滿東華2026》記者會時，親自為暗撻燈飾店老闆Gary長達半年的傳聞解畫。面對被指猶如主人家般出席男方父親喪禮及「釣金龜」等惡意指控，她罕見動氣作出最強烈反擊。這位女星親口道出當日現身靈堂背後那段鮮為人知隱情，真實內幕令人大感震驚。</p>\n<h2>陳庭欣現身《歡樂滿東華2026》親解喪禮內幕</h2>\n<p>針對被傳媒偷拍出席Gary父親喪禮並擔任送客角色的報導，她解釋二人相識逾1年，男方父親生前更是其匹克球學生。基於這份師徒情誼出席喪禮實屬禮貌與人之常情，當時站在必經門口純粹是為了道別離開，絕非以主人家身分打點。她對圈外朋友家屬白事遭公開拍攝及議論感到極度無奈與憤怒，更透露已私下向男方致歉。</p>\n<h2>女星罕見發火痛斥網絡釣金龜不實狂言</h2>\n<p>向來展現高情商的她留意到網上充斥大量未看內文便斷章取義的評論，甚至被惡意標籤打波是為了結識有錢人。她語氣堅定地直斥：「嗰啲comment我全部都有睇，有好多好偏激嘅，覺得我打Pickleball係為咗『釣金龜』嗰啲，其實完全根本都唔係！」她強調自己入行多年一直努力工作，打波純屬個人喜好，對部分網民無中生有的妄斷感到極度氣憤，明言無法逐一解釋流言。</p>\n<h2>結束上一段八年長跑直認最新感情狀況</h2>\n<p>對於網民質疑她結束上一段7年多感情後半年便火速尋找新歡，她反問感情根本沒有所謂正確數字與時間表。她大讚Gary性格及人品俱佳，目前雙方純屬互相了解中的好朋友階段，絕非外界盛傳已經蜜運半年。她重申從朋友昇華到戀人需要經歷漫長過程與時間，未來一切都會順其自然發展，感情事不能單用一刻去界定。</p>\n<h2>網民激辯陳庭欣與燈飾店老闆真實關係</h2>\n<p>這次親自拆解緋聞的舉動瞬間在各大社交平台引爆熱烈討論，一眾網民對事件抱持兩極看法。有大批粉絲留言力撐偶像，直指「朋友過身出席喪禮好正常」、「傳媒連圈外人白事都偷拍真係好過分」，對她無辜被罵深感不值。另一邊廂亦有網民對這段了解中的關係保持觀望態度，並留言「如果真係普通朋友點會傳得咁逼真」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795489077273242_118890216b04fd3654af5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"toby_yanyan_1780927217_3915016174878104341_1194171633.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795489077273242_118890216b04fd3654af5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516058518669174_10040041036afffa09d7e25.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-11-20 153243.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516058518669174_10040041036afffa09d7e25.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>男方Gary剛離婚兼育有一對子女（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/photo_6167689431129722042_y_137982888869b2dd2bc0f9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"中年危機三寶 hyrox 《東張》主持陳庭欣直指打匹克球已成她的日常。（圖片來源：陳庭欣IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/photo_6167689431129722042_y_137982888869b2dd2bc0f9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳庭欣被爆因熱愛匹克球而認識Gary。（圖片來源：陳庭欣IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179548908115757796_17039147046b04fd39c43ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ramsportsstadium_1788694137_3980176124533179829_77325941483.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179548908115757796_17039147046b04fd39c43ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>否認打Pickleball係為咗釣金龜傳聞（圖片來源：陳庭欣IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/20241228211749_a95154dd8a98b3d45236a97cd0455ad1e45fad68_136148539768a82a82b2f1e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳庭欣 林盛斌 於2025年底證實與拍拖8年的「十億男友」楊振源（Benny）分手，結束八年情。（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/20241228211749_a95154dd8a98b3d45236a97cd0455ad1e45fad68_136148539768a82a82b2f1e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>於2025年底證實與拍拖8年的「十億男友」楊振源（Benny）分手，結束八年情。（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/20241228211747_a24ef8607c3e0d26ecd165a0b380949c8d7ad4cd_13808053568a82a83bcfee-1024x589.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳庭欣 楊振源 甜蜜恩愛畫面頻頻曝光（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/20241228211747_a24ef8607c3e0d26ecd165a0b380949c8d7ad4cd_13808053568a82a83bcfee-1024x589.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>甜蜜恩愛畫面頻頻曝光（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%ad%a1%e6%a8%82%e6%bb%bf%e6%9d%b1%e8%8f%af2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">歡樂滿東華2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%87%a3%e9%87%91%e9%be%9c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">釣金龜</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%ba%ad%e6%ac%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳庭欣</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549042\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:23:56.661309+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1389,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:58:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:17:32.246430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:27.996068+00:00","content_hash":"d9cb8eb77405059c989a757cde985680d06e4d4ad5f5ceda533aa00e1c6bdf39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}